<p>Yes, the apparent incompetency is something that I had to use because of word constraints. When this contest is over I'd like to go back and fix it up.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">spoilers</a></div>
