<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The reason Dr. Wu opens up the cabinet in the first place is one of the inspirations for this skip. I have a friend who has technologically challenged parents in India and therefore, the only means of contact they have is over the telephone. Long distance calls, at least that long distance, is hella expensive! My friend now has a phone plan that supports this, but it too is pretty damn expensive.</p>
<p>So, when Dr. Wu was presented with a way to speak to<br />
her mom overseas, for free, with no apparent ill effects to her mom, she jumped on it. I mean, who knows how long it's been since they've spoken. Yes, she probably could have waited on more tests, but love is rarely logical.</p>
